{
    "id":  11702,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "WiFi LED Controller 3-in-1 RGB + RGBW + RGBCCT - RF 2.4 GHz - 12-24V",
    "reference":  "FL1855-FUT037W+",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3-in-1 WiFi LED Controller (RGB, RGBW, RGB+CCT, 12-24V)\u003c/strong\u003e – A professional and versatile solution to get the most out of your LED strips. With a power of up to 12A (6A per channel), allows creating and saving up to 4 custom scenes. Through the \u003cstrong\u003eTuya Smart App\u003c/strong\u003e you can adjust brightness, speed, direction, and dynamic modes. Compatible with voice control via Alexa and Google Assistant.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eWiFi LED Controller 3 in 1 RGB + RGBW + RGBCCT - RF 2.4 GHz - 12-24V\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e3-in-1 WiFi LED Controller\u003c/strong\u003e is the perfect solution for anyone looking for an advanced, versatile and easy-to-use lighting system. Designed for \u003cstrong\u003eRGB, RGBW and RGB+CCT\u003c/strong\u003e LED strips, it offers full compatibility and lets you make the most of every possibility in colour, brightness and light temperature.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a capacity of up to \u003cstrong\u003e12A (6A per channel)\u003c/strong\u003e, it guarantees stable, safe performance even in highly demanding installations. It also includes the ability to \u003cstrong\u003ecreate and save up to 4 custom scenes\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing you to adapt the lighting to any occasion: from a relaxing atmosphere at home to vibrant effects in a commercial space or at an event.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to the \u003cstrong\u003eTuya Smart App\u003c/strong\u003e, control becomes intuitive and complete. From your smartphone you can:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdjust \u003cstrong\u003ebrightness, speed, direction and dynamic modes\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSynchronise the lighting with music to create immersive effects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConfigure smart animations when switching the lights on or off.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomise colours and pixel points, achieving detailed, unique effects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe controller is also \u003cstrong\u003ecompatible with voice control\u003c/strong\u003e through \u003cstrong\u003eAlexa and Google Assistant\u003c/strong\u003e, offering a convenient, modern experience that lets you control your lights without needing remotes or apps.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnother of its great advantages is its \u003cstrong\u003ewide compatibility\u003c/strong\u003e: it works with handheld and wall-mounted RF remote controls, mobile apps, WiFi and even \u003cstrong\u003eDMX\u003c/strong\u003e systems, which makes it a professional option for residential, commercial and creative projects alike.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eRecommended uses:\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHome\u003c/strong\u003e: ambient lighting in living rooms, bedrooms or kitchens.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShops and businesses\u003c/strong\u003e: shop windows, bars, restaurants or exhibition areas.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvents and shows\u003c/strong\u003e: dynamic atmospheres and synchronisation with music.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCreative projects\u003c/strong\u003e: audiovisual studios, artistic installations or interactive projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eMain advantages:\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with \u003cstrong\u003eRGB, RGBW and RGB+CCT\u003c/strong\u003e strips (12-24V).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFull control from the \u003cstrong\u003eTuya Smart App\u003c/strong\u003e and by \u003cstrong\u003evoice (Alexa and Google Assistant)\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCapacity of \u003cstrong\u003eup to 12A (6A per channel)\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4 custom scenes\u003c/strong\u003e for every occasion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMusic synchronisation and smart animations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility with RF remotes, WiFi and \u003cstrong\u003eDMX\u003c/strong\u003e transmitter.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith the 3-in-1 WiFi LED Controller, you get a \u003cstrong\u003epowerful, modern and flexible\u003c/strong\u003e device that will turn any LED installation into a smart, customisable and easy-to-control system.\u003c/p\u003e",
